<%--
Invoice_Overdue_Date - an overdue invoice's due date: the date in the danger color with a
warning mark and the word "overdue", so the state reads without relying on color alone.

$date - the due date (a calendar date string, YYYY-MM-DD) (required)

Shown wherever an ISSUED invoice is past due (Invoice_Model's is_overdue): the invoices grid's
Due column and the invoice view.
--%>
<Define:Invoice_Overdue_Date tag="span">
    <i class="bi bi-exclamation-circle-fill"></i>
    <%= Rsx_Date.format(this.args.date) %>
    <span class="Invoice_Overdue_Date__label">overdue</span>
</Define:Invoice_Overdue_Date>
